{"unit":196,"section":8,"cefr":"B2","objective":"choose and use advanced passive constructions","skill":"Advanced Passive","heading":"Advanced passive","phrases":[{"he":"ההחלטה הוחלטה ברוב קולות.","en":"The decision was decided by a majority of votes.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"ההחלטה","h":["the decision"]},{"w":"הוחלטה","h":["was decided"]},{"w":"ברוב","h":["by a majority"]},{"w":"קולות","h":["votes","sounds"]}]},{"he":"הבניין נבנה בשנות השישים.","en":"The building was built in the sixties.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"הבניין","h":["the building"]},{"w":"נבנה","h":["was built"]},{"w":"בשנות","h":["in the years of"]},{"w":"השישים","h":["the sixties"]}]},{"he":"הידיעה נמסרה לכל העובדים.","en":"The news was delivered to all the employees.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"הידיעה","h":["the news","the information"]},{"w":"נמסרה","h":["was delivered","was passed on"]},{"w":"לכל","h":["to all"]},{"w":"העובדים","h":["the employees","the workers"]}]},{"he":"ההצעה נדחתה על ידי הוועדה.","en":"The proposal was rejected by the committee.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"ההצעה","h":["the proposal"]},{"w":"נדחתה","h":["was rejected"]},{"w":"על","h":["by"]},{"w":"ידי","h":["hands of"]},{"w":"הוועדה","h":["the committee"]}]},{"he":"התוכנית אושרה והופעלה מיד.","en":"The plan was approved and activated immediately.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"התוכנית","h":["the plan","the program"]},{"w":"אושרה","h":["was approved"]},{"w":"והופעלה","h":["and was activated"]},{"w":"מיד","h":["immediately"]}]}],"sentences":[{"he":"הבניין נבנה בשנות השישים.","en":"The building was built in the sixties.","alt":["The building was constructed in the sixties."],"t":"t"},{"he":"הדוח פורסם בעיתון הבוקר.","en":"The report was published in the morning paper.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הוחלט שהפגישה תתקיים מחר.","en":"It was decided that the meeting will take place tomorrow.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"מועד ההגשה נקבע ליום ראשון.","en":"The submission deadline was set for Sunday.","alt":["The deadline was determined for Sunday."],"t":"t"},{"he":"ההסכם הושג אחרי משא ומתן ארוך.","en":"The agreement was reached after long negotiations.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"המידע נמסר לתקשורת אתמול.","en":"The information was delivered to the media yesterday.","alt":["The information was passed to the media yesterday."],"t":"l"},{"he":"הוצעו שלושה פתרונות אפשריים.","en":"Three possible solutions were proposed.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הבקשה נדחתה בגלל מסמכים חסרים.","en":"The request was rejected because of missing documents.","alt":["The application was denied due to missing documents."],"t":"t"},{"he":"התקציב אושר פה אחד.","en":"The budget was approved unanimously.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"המערכת הופעלה לראשונה בשבוע שעבר.","en":"The system was activated for the first time last week.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הוא נחשב למומחה בתחום.","en":"He is considered an expert in the field.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הראיות הובאו לבית המשפט.","en":"The evidence was brought to the court.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"ההחלטה נלקחה בלי להתייעץ איתנו.","en":"The decision was taken without consulting us.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"השירות הורחב לאזורים נוספים.","en":"The service was expanded to additional areas.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"התקציב צומצם בעשרים אחוז.","en":"The budget was reduced by twenty percent.","alt":["The budget was cut by twenty percent."],"t":"l"},{"he":"הסקר נערך בקרב אלף אנשים.","en":"The survey was conducted among a thousand people.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הפרסום הוסר מהאתר.","en":"The advertisement was removed from the website.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"סעיף חדש נוסף לחוזה.","en":"A new clause was added to the contract.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הכביש נבנה בתוך שנתיים.","en":"The road was built within two years.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"התוצאות פורסמו באתר האינטרנט.","en":"The results were published on the website.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הוחלט להקים ועדה חדשה.","en":"It was decided to establish a new committee.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"התנאים נקבעו מראש.","en":"The conditions were determined in advance.","alt":["The terms were set in advance."],"t":"t"},{"he":"ההסכמה הושגה אחרי שעות של דיונים.","en":"The agreement was reached after hours of discussions.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"לא נמסר לנו שום מידע.","en":"No information was given to us.","alt":["We were not given any information."],"t":"l"},{"he":"הוצע שנדחה את ההחלטה.","en":"It was suggested that we postpone the decision.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"כל ההצעות נדחו חוץ מאחת.","en":"All proposals were rejected except one.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"החוק אושר בכנסת.","en":"The law was approved in the Knesset.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"המנוע הופעל מרחוק.","en":"The engine was activated remotely.","alt":["The motor was started remotely."],"t":"t"},{"he":"היא נחשבת לאחת המדעניות הטובות.","en":"She is considered one of the best scientists.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הציוד הובא מחוץ לארץ.","en":"The equipment was brought from abroad.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הזכות נלקחה ממנו בלי הסבר.","en":"The right was taken from him without explanation.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הפרויקט הורחב כדי לכלול ערים נוספות.","en":"The project was expanded to include additional cities.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"שעות הפעילות צומצמו בגלל חיסכון.","en":"The operating hours were reduced due to budget cuts.","alt":["The activity hours were cut because of savings."],"t":"l"},{"he":"המחקר נערך באוניברסיטה העברית.","en":"The research was conducted at the Hebrew University.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הסרטון הוסר בגלל תלונות.","en":"The video was removed because of complaints.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"שמות נוספו לרשימת המוזמנים.","en":"Names were added to the guest list.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הגשר נבנה על ידי מהנדסים מקומיים.","en":"The bridge was built by local engineers.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"השמועות פורסמו ברשתות החברתיות.","en":"The rumors were published on social media.","alt":["The rumors were spread on social networks."],"t":"t"},{"he":"נקבע שהמבחן יידחה בשבוע.","en":"It was determined that the exam will be postponed by a week.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"לא הושגה הסכמה בין הצדדים.","en":"No agreement was reached between the parties.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הבקשה אושרה והכסף הועבר.","en":"The request was approved and the money was transferred.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"כל הפרטים נמסרו למשטרה.","en":"All the details were delivered to the police.","alt":["All the details were given to the police."],"t":"l"},{"he":"התוספת שנוספה שינתה את כל התוכנית.","en":"The addition that was added changed the entire plan.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"המכתב הוסר מהתיק.","en":"The letter was removed from the file.","alt":[],"t":"t"}],"hints":{"הבניין":"the building","נבנה":"was built","בשנות":"in the years of","השישים":"the sixties","הדוח":"the report","פורסם":"was published","בעיתון":"in the newspaper","הבוקר":"the morning","הוחלט":"it was decided","שהפגישה":"that the meeting","תתקיים":"will take place","מחר":"tomorrow","מועד":"date / time","ההגשה":"the submission","נקבע":"was set / determined","ליום":"for the day / on","ראשון":"Sunday / first","ההסכם":"the agreement","הושג":"was reached / achieved","אחרי":"after","משא":"negotiation","ומתן":"and give","ארוך":"long","המידע":"the information","נמסר":"was delivered / given","לתקשורת":"to the media","אתמול":"yesterday","הוצעו":"were proposed","שלושה":"three","פתרונות":"solutions","אפשריים":"possible","הבקשה":"the request / application","נדחתה":"was rejected (feminine)","בגלל":"because of / due to","מסמכים":"documents","חסרים":"missing","התקציב":"the budget","אושר":"was approved","פה":"mouth / here","אחד":"one","המערכת":"the system","הופעלה":"was activated","לראשונה":"for the first time","בשבוע":"in the week","שעבר":"that passed / last","הוא":"he / is","נחשב":"is considered","למומחה":"as an expert","בתחום":"in the field","הראיות":"the evidence","הובאו":"were brought","לבית":"to the house","המשפט":"the court / justice","ההחלטה":"the decision","נלקחה":"was taken","בלי":"without","להתייעץ":"to consult","איתנו":"with us","השירות":"the service","הורחב":"was expanded"