 of","מהנדסים":"engineers","מקומיים":"local","השמועות":"the rumors","ברשתות":"on the networks","החברתיות":"the social (feminine)","שהמבחן":"that the exam","יידחה":"will be postponed","הסכמה":"agreement / consensus","בין":"between","הצדדים":"the sides / parties","והכסף":"and the money","הועבר":"was transferred","הפרטים":"the details","למשטרה":"to the police","התוספת":"the addition","שנוספה":"that was added","שינתה":"changed (feminine)","התוכנית":"the plan / program","המכתב":"the letter","מהתיק":"from the file","ההצעה":"the proposal","הוועדה":"the committee","לכל":"to all","העובדים":"the employees","הידיעה":"the news / information","נמסרה":"was delivered (feminine)","אושרה":"was approved (feminine)","והופעלה":"and was activated","מיד":"immediately","ברוב":"by a majority","קולות":"votes / sounds","הוחלטה":"was decided (feminine)","נמסרו":"were delivered / were handed over"},"words":[{"he":"נבנה","en":"was built","alt":["was constructed"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"nivna"},{"he":"פורסם","en":"was published","alt":["was released"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"pursam"},{"he":"הוחלט","en":"it was decided","alt":["was determined"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"hukhlat"},{"he":"נקבע","en":"was set","alt":["was determined","was established"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"nikba"},{"he":"הושג","en":"was reached","alt":["was achieved","was attained"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"husag"},{"he":"נמסר","en":"was delivered","alt":["was handed over"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"nimsar"},{"he":"הוצע","en":"was proposed","alt":["was suggested"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"hutza"},{"he":"נדחה","en":"was rejected","alt":["was postponed"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"nidkha"},{"he":"אושר","en":"was approved","alt":["was confirmed"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"ushar"},{"he":"הופעל","en":"was activated","alt":["was operated"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"huf'al"},{"he":"נחשב","en":"is considered","alt":["is regarded"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"nekhshav"},{"he":"הובא","en":"was brought","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"huva"},{"he":"נלקח","en":"was taken","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"nilkakh"},{"he":"הורחב","en":"was expanded","alt":["was widened"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"hurkhav"},{"he":"צומצם","en":"was reduced","alt":["was cut","was minimized"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"tzumtzam"},{"he":"נערך","en":"was conducted","alt":["was held","was organized"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"ne'erakh"},{"he":"הוסר","en":"was removed","alt":["was taken down"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"husar"},{"he":"נוסף","en":"was added","alt":["additional"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"nosaf"},{"he":"סעיף","en":"clause","alt":["section","paragraph"],"from":"skill","tr":"sa'if"},{"he":"הסכם","en":"agreement","alt":["accord"],"from":"skill","tr":"heskem"},{"he":"ועדה","en":"committee","alt":["commission"],"from":"skill","tr":"va'ada"},{"he":"הסכמה","en":"consensus","alt":["agreement"],"from":"skill","tr":"haskama"},{"he":"תקציב","en":"budget","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"taktziv"},{"he":"משא ומתן","en":"negotiation","alt":["negotiations"],"from":"phrase","tr":"masa umatan"}],"lexemes":["נבנה","נבנתה","נבנו","פורסם","פורסמה","פורסמו","הוחלט","הוחלטה","נקבע","נקבעה","נקבעו","הושג","הושגה","נמסר","נמסרה","נמסרו","הוצע","הוצעו","נדחה","נדחתה","נדחו","אושר","אושרה","הופעל","הופעלה","נחשב","נחשבת","נחשבים","הובא","הובאו","נלקח","נלקחה","הורחב","צומצם","צומצמו","נערך","נערכה","הוסר","נוסף","נוספו","סעיף","הסכם","ועדה","הסכמה","תקציב"],"tips":"## Advanced Passive: Nif'al and Huf'al\n\nHebrew has two main passive verb patterns:\n\n### Nif'al (נפעל) — Passive of Pa'al\n- **נבנה** (was built) ← בנה (built)\n- **נקבע** (was set) ← קבע (set)\n- **נמסר** (was delivered) ← מסר (delivered)\n- **נדחה** (was rejected) ← דחה (rejected)\n\n### Huf'al (הופעל) — Passive of Hif'il\n- **הוחלט** (was decided) ← החליט (decided)\n- **הושג** (was achieved) ← השיג (achieved)\n- **הובא** (was brought) ← הביא (brought)\n- **הורחב** (was expanded) ← הרחיב (expanded)\n\n### Pu'al (פועל) — Passive of Pi'el\n- **פורסם** (was published) ← פרסם (published)\n- **אושר** (was approved) ← אישר (approved)\n- **צומצם** (was reduced) ← צמצם (reduced)\n\n### The Agent\nUse **על ידי** (by) to express the agent:\n- הגשר **נבנה על ידי** מהנדסים = The bridge was built **by** engineers"}